especially of the [griffons]. Of course, that's the worst part because I have to feed them every day!'\nYou say, 'What griffons?'\nFenith says 'Oh those hateful fearsome beasts! They haunted my nightmares as a young satyr and now all my nightmares have come true. A horrible harpy, Ashrana was her name, swooped down from above commanding a griffon and whisked me, bound and helpless, [into the air]!'\nYou say, 'Into the air!'\nFenith says 'Why would you even ask me about riding them? You can't possibly want to ride a griffon [do] you?'\nYou say, 'I do'\nFenith says 'If you do then you're crazier than you look. Fine, I'll help you, but only if you help me! You can feed the griffon today instead of me! Haha! You see, if you want to ride the griffon, first you have to feed it or it just might eat you instead!. Combine some bear meat with a little snake meat, add in a puma paw and a tuft of bear fur and put it all in this Griffon Treat Kit and feed it to the griffon in the nest over there. If you're crazy enough to get that close to such a dangerous beast, he might let you ride him from place to place. Or he might eat your hand. One or the other . . .'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Blackfeather Roost, The Ledge'.\n\n---\n\nIf you want to ride the griffon first you have to feed it. Combine some bear meat with a little snake meat, add in a puma paw and a tuft of bear fur and put it all in this Griffon Treat Kit and feed it to the griffon in the nest over there. If you're crazy enough to get that close to such a dangerous beast he might let you ride him from place to place. Or he might eat your hand, one or the other...\n_You receive Fenith's Griffon Treat Kit, a 4 slot container._\n8. Give the treat to the Griffon near Fenith 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\n\n\n\n_The treat is made by combining the 4 items in the Treat Kit. All can be hunted in the area close to Fenith. Give it to \"a tame griffon\"._\n\n9. Return to Fenith to learn more about the Griffons 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Fenith'\n\n\n\n\nFenith says 'So you managed to feed the griffon and keep all your fingers?! Huh! Well, don't try feeding that same stale treat to the next griffon you encounter -- it won't work. Each griffon likes a different treat and it's up to you to find it. If you like, I can give you a [hint] of what the next griffon has a taste for.'\n_This is the lead-in to the second task, \"Blackfeather Roost, The Grove\"._\n**Submitted by:** Fight Clubx, Beastlord on The Nameless",
