      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Blackfeather Roost [zone=436]\n**Who:**\n- Coryn [ _Quest 50+_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 50\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Griffon Treat [item=52427]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a harpy noble [npc=23245]\n- a tame Griffon [npc=23221]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Blackfeather Roost #1 - Blackfeather Roost, The Ledge [quest=3606]\n- Blackfeather Roost #2 - Blackfeather Roost, The Grove [quest=3632]\n- Blackfeather Roost #4 - Blackfeather Roost, The Mesa [quest=3696]\n- Blackfeather Roost #5 - Reach the Royal Throne [quest=3695]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Oct 6 00:22:37 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _There are six islands in Blackfeather Roost, each with its own requirements for access (you can port from island to island after completing a short task for each):_\n\\- The Base (entered from Goru'kar Mesa)\n\\- The First Ledge ( see this task [quest=3606])\n\\- The Harpy Grove ( see this task [quest=3632])\n\\- The Harpy Cliffs (complete this task)\n\\- The Harpy Mesa ( see this task [quest=3696])\n\\- The Royal Throne ( see this task [quest=3695])\n\n---\n\n_Coryn is standing in front of you as you arrive the the harpy grove._\nYou say, 'Hail, Coryn'\nCoryn says 'No! Don't hurt poor Coryn! Coryn won't hurt you, Coryn [help] strong strangers! Please spare Coryn!'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nCoryn says 'Coryn will help you, yes! Strong strangers want to explore, yes? Coryn can help you explore if strong strangers help Coryn too! [Rescue] Coryn and Coryn will help!'\nYou say, 'I will rescue you'\nCoryn says 'Coryn is weak and the Nobles think it's fun to hurt Coryn. Coryn wants to take [revenge] but not strong enough. Will you take [revenge] for Coryn? If you do, Coryn gives you the treat you need to give the Griffon to explore more!'\nYou say, 'I will take revenge'\nCoryn says 'Kill two Nobles for Coryn and Coryn will help. Return when they are dead and Coryn will help strong strangers explore more.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Blackfeather Roost, The Cliffs'.\nKill two Nobles for Coryn and Coryn will help. Return when they are dead and Coryn will help strong strangers explore more.\nRevenge! Kill two harpy nobles 0/1 (Blacfeather Roost)\nHarpy nobles can be found nearby. Just watch out for wandering harpy patrollers.\nReturn to Coryn and tell her the deed is done 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\nYou say, 'Hail, Coryn'\nCoryn says 'Thank you, thank you strong stranger! Here is the treat you need to give to the Griffon in this grove. See? Coryn helps just like she said!'\nGive the treat to the Griffon in the Grove - Blackfeather Roost\n_Give the Griffon Treat to the Tame Griffon standing a little to your North East. You can now use his nest to reach the harpy cliffs._\n**Submitted by:** Lias Roxx, Defiant, Zek",
