      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Blackfeather Roost [zone=436]\n**Who:**\n- Mestle [npc=23255]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 50\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Griffon Treat [item=52428]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Lady Inthra [npc=23271]\n- a tame Griffon [npc=23221]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Blackfeather Roost #1 - Blackfeather Roost, The Ledge [quest=3606]\n- Blackfeather Roost #2 - Blackfeather Roost, The Grove [quest=3632]\n- Blackfeather Roost #3 - Blackfeather Roost, The Cliffs [quest=3672]\n- Blackfeather Roost #5 - Reach the Royal Throne [quest=3695]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Oct 7 04:23:39 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _There are six islands in Blackfeather Roost, each with its own requirements for access (you can port from island to island after completing a short task for each):_\n\\- The Base (entered from Goru'kar Mesa)\n\\- The First Ledge ( see this task [quest=3606])\n\\- The Harpy Grove ( see this task [quest=3632])\n\\- The Harpy Cliffs ( see this task [quest=3672])\n\\- The Harpy Mesa (complete this task)\n\\- The Royal Throne ( see this task [quest=3695])\n\n---\n\n_Mestle is found near where you're dropped off upon porting up to this island._\nYou say, 'Hail, Mestle'\nMestle says 'He he! So her [plan] worked I see. Welcome \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, welcome. He he!'\nYou say, 'What plan?'\nMestle says 'Why the plan to bring you here, of course! Didn't you notice how easily you've penetrated into the heart of our Roost? Our slaves Fenith and Coryn each played their part in this drama perfectly. Surely you must know that death lurks around every corner for one such as you, and you must have wondered at the ease you were able to delve deeper and deeper into our home. Now you must choose to [serve] our purpose, or die.'\nYou say, 'Serve?'\nMestle says 'If you can [prove] yourself worthy to me I will allow you to inch even further into our home. Prove yourself and you will be rewarded. Fail and you will be slain.'\nYou say, 'I will prove myself'\nMestle says 'There is one here who stands opposed to our purpose, one who must be eliminated for our [strategem] to proceed. If you [accept] my challenge, you will destroy Lady Inthra and prove you are worthy to continue onward and serve us.'\nYou say, 'Strategem?'\nMestle says 'That is none of your concern until you prove yourself to me! Now, quickly, before I lose my patience -- do you [accept] my challenge?'\nYou say, 'I accept the challenge'\nMestle says 'Kill her, \\_\\_\\_\\_, and return to me when you have done so. Only then will you be permitted to travel deeper into the roost.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Blackfeather Roost, The Mesa'.\nDo as Mestle...asked...and kill Lady Inthra 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\n_Lady Inthra has no protectors and is an easy kill. She is located next to the griffon nest/port-up to the next island._\nReturn to Mestle and report that the deed is done 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\nYou say, 'Hail, Mestle'\nYour task 'Blackfeather Roost, The Mesa' has been updated.\nMestle says 'Well done, \\_\\_\\_\\_. Frail as you seem you may be up to the task ahead of you, if you dare. Here is the griffon food you will need to continue on. Speak with my sister Ashrana, and quickly. She has gone to great effort to bring you this far - do not fail us now or we will turn our fury on you!'\nGive the treat to the Griffon on the Cliffs 0/1 (Blackfeather Roost)\n_After handing in the treat you can now use the griffon's nest on the Cliffs to reach the Mesa, where you will find Ashrana waiting._\n**Submitted by:** Lias Roxx, Defiant, Zek",
